** Fixture: one IM7/8552 [0/30/-30/90] element (unsymmetric, so B is not zero), 25 mm by 100 mm, under the uniform curvature kappa_x = 0.001 1/mm
** prescribed at its nodes: u = v = 0, w = -kappa x^2 / 2, theta_y = kappa x, theta_x = 0. The pure bending patch test of the flat shell (ADR-0053).
